<title>CANADA: Canada Aug bankruptcies rise over year.</title>
<headline>Canada Aug bankruptcies rise over year.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankruptcies in Canada rose to 7,456 in August from 7,143 a year earlier, the Department of Consumer and Corporate Affairs said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The department said 1,077 businesses and 6,379 consumers went bankrupt in the month.</p>
<p>In July, 7,454 bankruptcies were recorded.</p>
<p>For the year to date, 61,729 bankruptcies have been registered (9,717 businesses and 52,012 consumers), up from 50,912 in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745</p>
